EXPERIMENT 14 – Deep Q-Network (DQN)
AIM
To design and implement a Deep Q-Network (DQN) agent for a deterministic 1D Line World environment and analyze the effect of the max operator in target computation.

ALGORITHM
Initialize Q-network and target network with same parameters.

Initialize replay buffer.

For each episode:
• Reset environment
• Select action using ε-greedy policy
• Execute action and store transition

If buffer has enough samples:
